        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Air Combat: Overheat&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for exciting air battles! &quot;Air Combat: Overheat&quot; is a 2D Roguelike game full of challenges and fun. Become a brave pilot, fly your favorite plane, and show your skills against endless enemies and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my telegram: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Air Battles</strong>: Fight various enemies and enjoy the thrilling combat!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/8ded12a3b70b9383f36448d75fcc0e49.poster.avif?t=1755649696\" width=548 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/8ded12a3b70b9383f36448d75fcc0e49.webm?t=1755649696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/8ded12a3b70b9383f36448d75fcc0e49.mp4?t=1755649696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items and Upgrades</strong>: Buy items and upgrade skills after each battle to make your plane stronger and unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/584b7ca5f1dd4fce9cb2e37fceba9e27.poster.avif?t=1755649696\" width=548 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/584b7ca5f1dd4fce9cb2e37fceba9e27.webm?t=1755649696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/584b7ca5f1dd4fce9cb2e37fceba9e27.mp4?t=1755649696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overheat System</strong>: Watch your plane's heat levels. If it gets too hot, performance drops and it takes damage. Manage heat wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Planes</strong>: From nimble scouts to powerful fighters, pick the plane that suits your style!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/4aae6b807d10e1990387feb628433a47.poster.avif?t=1755649696\" width=548 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/4aae6b807d10e1990387feb628433a47.webm?t=1755649696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/4aae6b807d10e1990387feb628433a47.mp4?t=1755649696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong>: Face strong bosses and use your strategy and skills to defeat them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/3ffc0233c9fc62c0ef0817039bee1d70.poster.avif?t=1755649696\" width=548 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/3ffc0233c9fc62c0ef0817039bee1d70.webm?t=1755649696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590390/extras/3ffc0233c9fc62c0ef0817039bee1d70.mp4?t=1755649696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Maps</strong>: Explore beautiful maps, each with its own challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your plane, keep it cool, and face every enemy in the air to become the top air combat hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Contents:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique levels and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced gameplay, each level lasts up to about 20 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different fighter jet models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable fighter jet colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ active skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ passive items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards</p></li></ul>",
